  "name": "Sea Otter, Boat Survey Design, Bathymetry",
  "description": "Data Type: Mammals; These coverages were derived from the integration of pre-existing boat survey design for sea otters with bathymetry data. Scale for the boat survey is 1:63,360 the scale for the bathymetry is unknown.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Unknown",
